       light, low over the beach, NE/SE, medium speed, about 30 centimeters at 600 meters;
       rising up behind Ponta do Bácuri, then disappearing beyond the point.

771211/03:25 – Belém Municipality - Baía do Sol (Mosqueiro) – Pulsing pale
       yellow light below 2,500 meters, 1,200 meters away, apparent size 10 centimeters;
       slow speed moving NE/SW.

780124/00:09 – Belém Municipality - Guajará River, Benfica (Keuffer Olaria) – Reddish-
       yellow light NW/S low (800 feet), 3,000 meters away, apparent size 5 centimeters;
       medium speed; no sound.
